Error: Jet.ValueNotSendable: `task_fixed` can't cross into a task because `mem.Fixed` isn't sendable
  --> Tests/UI/fixed_backing_crossing.jet:7:18
    |
  7 |     worker: task {
    |                  ^
 Why: `Fixed` is declared `#Local`, so its values stay on the thread that made them; tasks and channels move owned values between threads
 Fix: Give the task plain owned data, or rebuild the value as an owned copy before spawning
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ValueNotSendable

Error: Jet.ValueNotSendable: `parallel_fixed` can't cross a parallel worker boundary because `mem.Fixed` isn't sendable
  --> Tests/UI/fixed_backing_crossing.jet:13:24
    |
 13 |     _: values.para_map(fn(n: Int) {
    |                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Fixed` is declared `#Local`, so its values stay on the thread that made them; this concurrent boundary moves owned values between workers
 Fix: Copy plain owned data into the worker, or keep this operation sequential
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ValueNotSendable
